e-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:435:      - \"tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:436:    reviewScopeSummary: \"Reviewed Story 1 against AC-1.1 through AC-1.4, including the Convex archive entry mutation/query, schema and PlatformStore wiring, shared archive contracts, documented TC mappings, the local test harness, and the configured story/epic gates.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:444:        evidence: \"The story scope explicitly defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment to later stories (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:36-38`, `174-178`), but the same story still requires TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b coverage (`.../01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:156-166`, `192-199`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:36-44`). Those mapped files do not exist (`tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`), `rg` found no `ArchiveFinalizationService`/`appendFinalizedEntry` or `ArchiveReadService`/`getArchive` implementation under `apps/platform/server/services`, and the only executable proof is the Convex handler test (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:196-236`, `370-436`). That leaves finalized user/model/process-event archival and degraded related-context reads without the required story-level evidence.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:446:          - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:447:          - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:448:          - \"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:449:          - \"tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:450:          - \"tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:464:        title: \"The production archive read path paginates after loading the full process archive\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:465:        evidence: \"`listArchiveEntries` reads `by_processId_and_sequence` with `.collect()` and only then slices in `paginateArchiveEntries` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155`, `261-280`). The story/design describe this store method as returning one bounded page (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:126-127`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:661-668`). The outward page contract is correct, but long-process production reads still materialize the full archive in memory.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/