n for the scoped durable archive append/read primitive and its mapped tests.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"promptAddendum\\\":\\\"Implement Story 1 only: canonical archive entry persistence. Before touching Convex code, read convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md. Stay within the story scope: archiveEntries Convex append/read functions, schema/indexes, shared archive contract/store surface as needed, required taxonomy validation, per-process sequence assignment, processId+finalizationKey idempotency, stable ascending sequence reads, nullable related artifact/source/tool context ids, and basic page shape. Do not implement live finalization hooks, UI/routes, turn/derived-view records, provenance enrichment beyond stored ids, or migrations/backfill. Add/update the mapped tests for TC-1.1a through TC-1.4b plus atomic sequence/idempotency behavior where this story owns them. Run the narrowest relevant verification you can, prioritizing pnpm run test:convex, and report exact commands and outcomes.\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"First planner turn dispatched implementation; later turns should require concrete child evidence before verify or acceptance.\\\"}\"}}\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:7:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-verify\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Implementation reported ready-for-verification with story and epic gates passing, but no verifier result exists yet. The smallest safe next action is an independent verification pass against the implementor artifact and story-local requirements before any acceptance recommendation.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"artifactRefs\\\":[\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/004-implementor.json\\\"],\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Verify Story 1 canonical