emoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json reports status needs-user-decision and outcome needs-human-ruling.\\\",\\\"Open blocking finding S1-F1 says Story 1 defers live finalization hooks, archive read routes/UI, and read-time provenance enrichment while still requiring TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b evidence.\\\",\\\"Requirement coverage in the verifier marks AC-1.2 and AC-1.3 verified, but AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 unverified.\\\",\\\"All gates reported by the verifier passed: targeted Convex test, green-verify, and verify-all.\\\"],\\\"allowedResponses\\\":[\\\"primitive-only evidence is sufficient; defer TC-1.1/TC-1.4 service/API proof\\\",\\\"TC-1.1 and TC-1.4 mapped service/API tests remain in scope; implement before acceptance\\\",\\\"block story until story/test-plan wording is corrected\\\"]}}\"}}\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:15:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-verify\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Impl-lead ruling resolves the verifier's blocking scope question, but acceptance still requires a fresh verifier outcome that applies the ruling and clears or reclassifies open findings. Reuse the existing verifier continuation so the next result can explicitly reconcile S1-F1 against the ruling and confirm whether any blocker remains.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"artifactRefs\\\":[\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-ruling-response-001.json\\\"],\\\"verifierContinuationRef\\\":\\\"storyVerifier\\\