objects remain outside archive truth | Story 2 | TC-2.1a, TC-2.2a, TC-2.2b | `tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`; `tests/service/client/process-live.test.ts` |\ntests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts:170:  it('TC-2.3a completed live object archived once through finalization service', async () => {\ntests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts:201:  it('TC-2.3b replayed completion does not duplicate entry through service boundary', async () => {\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:44:- Story 2 finalization boundary\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive.md:1:# Story 2: Finalization Boundary Between Live State and Archive\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive.md:72:- **TC-2.3a: Completed live object archived once through finalization service**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive.md:76:- **TC-2.3b: Replayed completion does not duplicate archive entry through service boundary**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive.md:87:Story 2 is the control-plane finalization seam. It decides which completed\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive.md:125:- `process-live-normalizer.ts` remains unchanged except where tests assert live/archive separation.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive.md:141:| TC-2.3a | `tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts` | completed live object archived once through finalization service |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-