/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/tech-design-client.md:410:| TC-5.3b | multiple side-work items remain distinguishable | `tests/service/client/side-work-section.test.ts` | Multiple side-work items | Distinct labels/statuses shown |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/tech-design-client.md:411:| TC-5.4a | completed side work shows returned result | `tests/service/client/side-work-section.test.ts` | Completed side-work item | Result summary shown |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/tech-design-client.md:412:| TC-5.4b | failed side work shows failure outcome | `tests/service/client/side-work-section.test.ts` | Failed side-work item | Failure summary shown |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/tech-design-client.md:413:| TC-5.4c | parent-process change shown after side-work outcome | `tests/service/client/process-work-surface-page.test.ts` | Side-work result plus process change | Parent process state visibly updated |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/tech-design-client.md:567:- `tests/service/client/process-response-composer.test.ts`\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:80:- process-unavailable and access-denied responses\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:81:- degraded section-envelope responses\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:137:| `tests/service/server/process-actions-api.test.ts` | Service | action-availability enforcement, idempotency, response contract | 4 |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:143:| `tests/service/client/process-response-composer.test.ts` | Service | response validation and submission UX | 3 |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:148:| `tests/integration/process-work-surface.test.ts` | Integration | assembled process route, reload, response persistence, reconnect path | 4 |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:192:| `omits project data from forbidden bootstrap response` | Prevents data leakage through direct API access |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:205:| `respond returns PROCESS_ACTION_NOT_AVAILABLE when process is not accepting a response` | Prevents false interactive states |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:206:| `response deduplicates repeated clientRequestId within one process` | Defensive write protection for retry/replay conditions |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:257:| TC-2.5a | `TC-2.5a successful start updates the page without manual refresh` | Successful start response | Click start | Page state updates |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:258:| TC-2.5b | `TC-2.5b successful resume updates the page without manual refresh` | Successful resume response | Click resume | Page state updates |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:259:| TC-3.1a | `TC-3.1a multi-turn discussion remains in one process page` | Existing conversation + successful response | Submit response | Same page and history continue |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:260:| TC-3.6a | `TC-3.6a accepted response appears in page history in-session` | Successful response | Submit response | History item visible |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:261:| TC-3.6b | `TC-3.6b resulting request or process state updates in-session` | Successful response | Submit response | Current request/process state updates |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:262:| TC-5.4c | `TC-5.4c parent-process change becomes visible after side-work outcome` | Side-work result + process update | Apply update | Process summary changes |\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/test-plan.md:283:| TC-3.3a | `TC-3.3a shows submitted response in visible history` | U